The content must be provided by using [BASE64](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64) representation, as shown in the example.

A full list of media types is available in the [media types](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_media_typeList_of_common_media_types) article.

See the following example JSON document that includes an inline attachment of a jpeg image:

{
"_id":"document_with_attachment",
"_attachments":
{
"name_of_attachment": {
